  "text": "End of course test, track 3. Some of Newton's work is not very easy to understand unless you are a mathematician. 2 So it's perhaps not surprising that Newton stopped showing people his work. 3 Like many people at the time, Newton tried to change ordinary metal into gold. His scientific achievements are not quite as amazing as Newton's or Einstein's. 5 Because he was very excited about astronomy, he was able to show ordinary people how exciting it is too, a talent that not many scientists have. 6 His show had 135 million viewers from all over the world, which even today is quite a few people.",
